  "filename": "biglybt.config",
  "filename_basis": "ConfigurationManager.CONFIG_FILENAME; current native Host same fixed choice. azureus.config is untouched and is not a fallback.",
  "policy_differences": [
    "50 selected fields only; unknown and dormant fields retain exact raw original subtrees.",
    "Original Default save path is platform-derived and therefore unavailable until explicitly saved; no home path fabricated.",
    "Original LAN Speed Enabled default is true; native NetworkPolicy missing fallback is false and explicit true unsupported. Sparse read/save does not materialize either default.",
    "Native editor limits rates to nonnegative INT_MAX/1024 KiB/s and queue caps to 1000000; preexisting incompatible values remain visible, are not silently clamped or defaulted.",
    "Rename Incomplete Files and suffix are OriginalOnly: existing importer does not implement new-import naming; no payload rename or move.",
    "Backup/Saving snapshots remain diagnostic read-only until explicitly recovered outside this API. ConfigFile original storage errors are passed through."
  ]
